When you are facing a summoning storm, there are a few options you have
to survive:

1) Leave the level - Levelport, cursed gain level, digging
2) Hide - Read a scroll of earth.  If the summoning monster can't see
you, it won't summon.
3) Engrave/Burn Elbereth - Although some nasties will ignore it, most
will not attack you.
4) Teleport away the caster - The summoner has to be close to you to
cast offensive spells.
5) Breaking a wand of teleportation - when surrounded can give you a
little breathing room.



